<div class=" vdc-text--primary  "><h4>Event details:</h4>
<p>'UI.ready'</p>
<ul>
<li>The event is triggered when the SDK has successfully opened the UI, and the session is beginning. This event returns no data.</li>
</ul>
<p>'UI. closed'</p>
<ul>
<li>The event is triggered when the user closes the webpage, or the session expires, and the window is closed automatically.</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>User Actions – Events letting the client know about actions made by the user in the window.</strong></p>
<p>'UI.Card.added'</p>
<ul>
<li>User has added a new card</li>
</ul>
<p>'UI.Card.removed'</p>
<ul>
<li>User has removed a card</li>
</ul>
<p>'UI.Card.updated'</p>
<ul>
<li>User has updated one of the cards already uploaded</li>
</ul>
<p>'UI.Card.made-default'</p>
<ul>
<li>User has made a new card their default</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="section3">Step 5: Event Unsubscription</h3>
<p>The&nbsp;VisaSecureCapture.off(eventName)&nbsp;function allows the client to unsubscribe from events.</p>
